1
00:00:00,117 --> 00:00:00,950
I checked their history.

2
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:02,568
Long ago they swapped things.

3
00:00:02,608 --> 00:00:04,369
A fish for a loaf of bread. The problem:

4
00:00:04,409 --> 00:00:05,949
if the baker wants no fish today,

5
00:00:05,989 --> 00:00:06,591
you go hungry.

6
00:00:06,631 --> 00:00:07,355
Holding a fish.

7
00:00:07,395 --> 00:00:10,400
So they tried other things everybody would take. Salt. Shells.

8
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:11,207
And on one island,

9
00:00:11,247 --> 00:00:12,403
stones as big as a car.

10
00:00:12,443 --> 00:00:13,564
Imagine asking for change.

11
00:00:13,604 --> 00:00:14,863
They settled on gold:

12
00:00:14,903 --> 00:00:17,428
rare, never rots, hard to fake.

13
00:00:17,913 --> 00:00:18,847
But gold is heavy.

14
00:00:18,887 --> 00:00:20,686
So they left it with someone trusted and took

15
00:00:20,726 --> 00:00:21,236
a receipt.

16
00:00:21,276 --> 00:00:23,753
The receipt started changing hands: paper money.

17
00:00:23,991 --> 00:00:26,688
In 1971 the dollar was cut loose from gold.

18
00:00:26,728 --> 00:00:27,897
The paper stood on its own.

19
00:00:27,937 --> 00:00:29,652
And whoever runs the printing press can print as

20
00:00:29,692 --> 00:00:30,547
much as they like.

21
00:00:30,587 --> 00:00:32,796
In Zimbabwe, they printed a single note for one

22
00:00:32,836 --> 00:00:33,704
hundred trillion dollars.

23
00:00:33,744 --> 00:00:35,164
It would not buy a bus ticket.

24
00:00:35,204 --> 00:00:37,316
So money's value comes from one thing:

25
00:00:37,356 --> 00:00:38,382
everyone believes in it.

26
00:00:38,422 --> 00:00:39,389
A group agreement.

27
00:00:39,429 --> 00:00:40,778
Like a line at the coffee shop.

28
00:00:40,818 --> 00:00:42,750
It works until somebody cuts.

29
00:00:42,889 --> 00:00:45,264
So, if money is just an agreement,

30
00:00:45,304 --> 00:00:47,667
could someone make money without a bank?

31
00:00:47,757 --> 00:00:49,905
That actually happened and the full story is on

32
00:00:49,945 --> 00:00:51,403
the Earth Report channel.

33
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:53,490
Subscribe to the channel and turn on the bell

34
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:56,195
so my secret reports on your planet reach you first.
